---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<MainLayout
title="AI Tool Categories | CreatorStack"
description="Browse AI tools by category including writing, design, video editing, voice generation, coding and productivity."
canonical="https://creatorstack2-0.pages.dev/categories"
>

<!-- HERO -->

<section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-purple-700 py-28 text-white">

<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 text-center">

<span class="rounded-full bg-white/20 px-5 py-2 font-semibold">

📂 Browse Categories

</span>

<h1 class="mt-8 text-6xl font-extrabold">

Find AI Tools by Category

</h1>

<p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-4xl text-2xl leading-10 text-blue-100">

Explore our growing collection of AI software organized by category to quickly find the best tool for your needs.

</p>

</div>

</section>

<!-- CATEGORIES -->

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24">

<div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">

<!-- Writing -->

<a href="/reviews/chatgpt" class="group rounded-3xl border bg-white p-10 shadow transition hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl">

<div class="text-5xl">✍️</div>

<h2 class="mt-6 text-3xl font-bold group-hover:text-blue-600">

AI Writing

</h2>

<p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-8">

Writing assistants, copywriting tools, blogging software and content generation platforms.

</p>

<p class="mt-8 font-bold text-blue-600">

Explore →

</p>

</a>

<!-- Design -->

<a href="/reviews/canva-ai" class="group rounded-3xl border bg-white p-10 shadow transition hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl">

<div class="text-5xl">🎨</div>

<h2 class="mt-6 text-3xl font-bold group-hover:text-blue-600">

AI Design

</h2>

<p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-8">

Graphic design, presentations, logos, social media graphics and creative AI tools.

</p>

<p class="mt-8 font-bold text-blue-600">

Explore →

</p>

</a>

<!-- Video -->

<a href="/reviews/veed" class="group rounded-3xl border bg-white p-10 shadow transition hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl">

<div class="text-5xl">🎬</div>

<h2 class="mt-6 text-3xl font-bold group-hover:text-blue-600">

AI Video

</h2>

<p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-8">

Video editing, subtitles, avatars, screen recording and AI video generation.

</p>

<p class="mt-8 font-bold text-blue-600">

Explore →

</p>

</a>

<!-- Voice -->

<div class="rounded-3xl border bg-white p-10 shadow">

<div class="text-5xl">🎤</div>

<h2 class="mt-6 text-3xl font-bold">

AI Voice

</h2>

<p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-8">

Voice generation, voice cloning, narration and text-to-speech software.

</p>

<p class="mt-8 font-bold text-gray-400">

Coming Soon

</p>

</div>

<!-- Coding -->

<div class="rounded-3xl border bg-white p-10 shadow">

<div class="text-5xl">💻</div>

<h2 class="mt-6 text-3xl font-bold">

AI Coding

</h2>

<p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-8">

Code assistants, debugging tools, code generation and developer AI software.

</p>

<p class="mt-8 font-bold text-gray-400">

Coming Soon

</p>

</div>

<!-- Productivity -->

<div class="rounded-3xl border bg-white p-10 shadow">

<div class="text-5xl">🚀</div>

<h2 class="mt-6 text-3xl font-bold">

AI Productivity

</h2>

<p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-8">

Automation, note taking, scheduling, research and workplace AI tools.

</p>

<p class="mt-8 font-bold text-gray-400">

Coming Soon

</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- CTA -->

<section class="bg-gray-50 py-24">

<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 text-center">

<h2 class="text-5xl font-extrabold">

Looking for the Best Overall AI Tools?

</h2>

<p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl text-xl leading-9 text-gray-600">

Not sure which category to choose? Browse our complete ranking of the best AI tools we've tested.

</p>

<a
href="/best-ai-tools-2026"
class="mt-10 inline-flex rounded-2xl bg-blue-600 px-10 py-5 text-xl font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-blue-700">

🏆 View Best AI Tools 2026

</a>

</div>

</section>

<Footer />

</MainLayout>